window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>He marked me. Then he bred me.</b></p> <p>When this alpha shifter warlord caught my scent, he didn't just take me as his mate. He pinned me to the wall, tore off my clothes, spanked my ass, and then made me come so hard I screamed.</p> <p>Now, bare and blindfolded as he throws me to the bed and mounts me roughly, I know what comes next.</p> <p>He's going to claim my virgin body with a single brutal thrust.</p> <p>Then he's going to breed me hard.</p> <p>His Mark <i>is a standalone romance, which is the second book in Sara's bestselling series Alphas of the Rocky Mountains. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
